   <indicator aggregation-status="1" ascending="0" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Draft regulatory act on internal regulation in the field of services and investments developed, defining the basic principles and conditions for the implementation of regulatory activities (in particular, activities related to the issuance of permits, licenses, etc.) in accordance with the obligations under the GATS developed.</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development of a draft regulatory act on internal regulation on services and investments, defining the basic principles and conditions for the implementation of regulatory activities (in particular, activities related to the issuance of permits, licenses, etc.) in accordance with the obligations under the GATS (General Agreement on Trade in Services).
An analytical note describing the basic obligations of the GATS and a draft regulation prepared.</narrative>
    </description>
