   <indicator aggregation-status="1" ascending="0" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Analysis of the Tax Code conducted, and proposals prepared to bring it into line with the provisions of the WTO agreements.</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">In order to harmonize legislation in accordance with WTO norms, amendments to the Tax Code of Turkmenistan drafted for their incorporation in the legal framework in accordance with the advanced norms of international trade law.
Consultations held and workshops organized on ways to protect the services market in the context of WTO liberalization on the example of financial services.</narrative>
    </description>
