   <indicator aggregation-status="1" ascending="0" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Draft list of obligations on access to the banking, financial and other services market prepared.</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preparation of a draft list of obligations for access to the banking, financial and other services market. A tentative negotiating position on access to the markets of banking, financial and other services under the jurisdiction of the Ministry of Finance and Economy of Turkmenistan formed - a draft methodology for developing lists of obligations for the WTO, which would allow national specialists to familiarize themselves with the forms and methods of work on the formation of such a position and replicate it in other sectors of the economy.</narrative>
    </description>
